# Force LF line endings in the repository for everything text.
#
# Why: this code is edited on Windows but runs on Ubuntu. Without this, Git
# would store CRLF, and a CRLF in a systemd unit, an nginx config, or a shell
# script is a syntax error on Linux -- the classic "works locally, breaks on
# deploy" bug. eol=lf normalises on commit AND checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.db   binary
*.mpkx binary
